      <p><span class="only-desktop">Stops the dev servers, watchers and simulators that closed Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI and Copilot sessions left running, shows the memory each one holds, and ends idle sessions so you can resume them later.</span><span class="only-mobile">Stops dev servers that closed agent sessions left running, and shows the memory each one holds.</span></p>
