      <h3>Compress, losslessly</h3>
      <p><span class="only-desktop">PNGs, JPEGs, PDFs, WAV and AIFF audio, Office files and folders you rarely open get smaller without losing a pixel or a byte. Each result is checked against the original before it's swapped in, and the original goes to the Trash.</span><span class="only-mobile">PNGs, JPEGs, PDFs, audio, Office files and folders get smaller with nothing lost. Every file is checked first.</span></p>
    </article>
