      <h3>Shrink, opt-in and lossy</h3>
      <p><span class="only-desktop">Off until you turn it on. Re-encodes JPEG and HEIC photos, videos (to HEVC) and the images inside PDFs at a lower quality, with a before-and-after preview. A file is only replaced if it gets at least 15% smaller, and the original goes to the Trash.</span><span class="only-mobile">Off by default. Photos, videos and PDFs at a lower quality, previewed first, originals in the Trash.</span></p>
